          },
          {
            "readme_said": "(nothing about headless use)",
            "actually_needed": "termscp is TUI-only. To test it without an interactive terminal, run it under `script -qfec` and feed keystrokes through a pipe. In this box the screen output was not captured, so results came from ~/.cache/termscp/termscp.log and from files on disk.",
