          },
          {
            "readme_said": "Connect through built-in bookmarks and recent connections",
            "actually_needed": "Connecting with an address on the CLI (termscp ftp://user@host:port) did not add an entry under [recents] in ~/.config/termscp/bookmarks.toml.",
